+    local_path: _LIBRARY/tactic-premortem-risk-identification.md
+  - id: TACTIC:problem-decomposition
+    kind: tactic
+    title: Problem Decomposition
+    summary: "Break a complex, ambiguous problem into a set of smaller, independently tractable sub-problems before selecting a solution approach. Decomposition prevents premature convergence on a solution that addresses only part of the problem, exposes hidden scope, and creates a structured basis for work-package planning and parallel progress.\n"
