+    kind: tactic
+    title: 'Refactoring: Consolidate Conditional Expression'
+    summary: "Merge multiple sequential conditional checks that produce the same result into a single combined condition, then extract it into a named predicate function. Replaces mechanical guard sequences with a self-documenting intent declaration.\n"
+    source_path: ''
+    local_path: _LIBRARY/tactic-refactoring-consolidate-conditional-expression.md
+  - id: TACTIC:refactoring-encapsulate-record
