+  - Neither file exists (including `.troupe/` missing) → `LoadError("no configuration file: <dir>/.troupe/troupe.yml (or troupe.yaml)")`.
+  - Both exist → `LoadError("both <…>/troupe.yml and <…>/troupe.yaml exist; remove one")` (name both).
